    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to present a wonderful and rare opportunity to purchase this three bedroom detached cottage set amidst the charming and historical countryside of St. Margaret's. The property sits on a mature site of c. 0.95 of an acre, which enjoys incredible peace and is surrounded by rolling lawns and mature trees .\r\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 139 sq m comprises storm porch, kitchen/diner, utility room, bathroom, living room and downstairs bedroom. Upstairs boasts 2 main bedrooms and main family bathroom.\r\nThe surrounding areas are no less than jaw dropping and boast mature planting, hedging and stud railing.\r\nRushwee Cottage is presented in very good condition throughout and boasts a long list of additional features to include a heaps of built in storage, dual aspect living space. The home oozes potential to be transformed into the ultimate family home.\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised, call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 01 5541699 for further information or to arrange viewing!!\r\n\r\nFeatures;\r\n- c. 139 sq m\r\n- BER E2\r\n- Detached home\r\n- Flooded with natural light\r\n- Incredible potential for further development\r\n- Secluded laneway\r\n- Mature planting\r\n- Lawn and field\r\n- On c. 0.95 acres\r\n- On c. 0.385 hectares\r\n- 3 Bedroom and 2 bathroom\r\n- Built in storage\r\n- Fitted Kitchen\r\n- Ample parking for two cars\r\n- Within easy reach of M50 Motorway\r\n- Viewing highly advised!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "James Droney"
      }
